{"kind":"communion","label":"領主詠","heading":"領主詠","citation":"詠 73:28","lines":[{"zh":"親近天主是我的喜樂，只有上主才是我的期望。","yale":["chān","gahn","tīn","jyú","sih","ngóh","dīk","héi","lohk",null,"jí","yáuh","seuhng","jyú","chòih","sih","ngóh","dīk","kèih","mohng",null]},{"zh":"或","yale":["waahk"]},{"zh":"主說：我實在告訴你們：你們不論求什麼，只要信，必賜給你們。","yale":["jyú","syut",null,"ngóh","saht","joih","gou","sou","néih","mùhn",null,"néih","mùhn","bāt","leuhn","kàuh","sahm","mō",null,"jí","yiu","seun",null,"bīt","chi","kāp","néih","mùhn",null]},{"zh":"（領主後默禱片刻）","yale":[null,"líhng","jyú","hauh","mahk","tóu","pin","hāk",null]}],"proper":true,"en":{"source":"iBreviary","citation":"Ps 73 (72): 28","lines":["To be near God is my happiness,","to place my hope in God the Lord.","Or: Mk 11: 23-24","Amen, I say to you: Whatever you ask in prayer,","believe that you will receive,","and it shall be given to you, says the Lord."]},"la":{"source":"iBreviary","citation":"Ps 72, 28","lines":["Mihi autem adhærére Deo bonum est,","pónere in Dómino Deo spem meam.","Vel: Mc 11, 23-24","Amen dico vobis, quidquid orántes pétitis,","crédite quia accipiétis, et fiet vobis, dicit Dóminus."]}},{"kind":"postcommunion","label":"領聖體後經","heading":"領聖體後經","citation":null,"lines":[{"zh":"上主，我們按照你聖子的命令，為紀念他而舉行了感恩祭宴，並領受了他的體血；求你藉這共融聖事，加強我們的愛德。因主耶穌基督之名，求你俯聽我們的祈禱。亞孟。","yale":["seuhng","jyú",null,"ngóh","mùhn","on","jiu","néih","sing","jí","dīk","mihng","lihng",null,"waih","géi","nihm","tā","yìh","géui","hàhng","líuh","gám","yān","jai","yin",null,"bihng","líhng","sauh","líuh","tā","dīk","tái","hyut",null,"kàuh","néih","jihk","jéh","guhng","yùhng","sing","sih",null,"gā","kèuhng","ngóh","mùhn","dīk","oi","dāk",null,"yān","jyú","yèh","sōu","gēi","dūk","jī","méng",null,"kàuh","néih","fú","tēng","ngóh","mùhn","dīk","kèih","tóu",null,"a","màhng",null]},{"zh":"或","yale":["waahk"]},{"zh":"十一月十八日","yale":["sahp","yāt","yuht","sahp","baat","yaht"]},{"zh":"常年期第三十三周星期三","yale":["sèuhng","nìhn","kèih","daih","sāam","sahp","sāam","jāu","sīng","kèih","sāam"]},{"zh":"聖伯多祿大殿及聖保祿大殿奉獻日","yale":["sing","baak","dō","luhk","daaih","dihn","kahp","sing","bóu","luhk","daaih","dihn","fuhng","hin","yaht"]},{"zh":"聖伯多祿大殿及聖保祿大殿，與聖母大殿（8月5日紀念）及拉特朗大殿（11月9日紀念）合稱為羅馬四大聖殿。","yale":["sing","baak","dō","luhk","daaih","dihn","kahp","sing","bóu","luhk","daaih","dihn",null,"yúh","sing","móuh","daaih","dihn",null,null,"yuht",null,"yaht","géi","nihm",null,"kahp","lāai","dahk","lóhng","daaih","dihn",null,null,null,"yuht",null,"yaht","géi","nihm",null,"hahp","chīng","wàih","lòh","máh","sei","daaih","sing","dihn",null]},{"zh":"尼祿皇帝迫害教會期間，聖伯多祿宗徒於64年，在尼祿競技場被釘十字架殉道，死後被葬於競技場附近，即梵蒂岡小山丘上的公共墓地中。第二世紀時，教友已在他的墓上蓋建紀念龕。324年，君士坦丁皇帝在伯多祿墳墓上興建大殿。十五世紀，原有大殿被拆除，1626年重建後祝聖。","yale":["nèih","luhk","wòhng","dai","bīk","hoih","gaau","wúi","kèih","gāan",null,"sing","baak","dō","luhk","jūng","tòuh","yū",null,null,"nìhn",null,"joih","nèih","luhk","ging","geih","chèuhng","beih","dēng","sahp","jih","gá","sēun","douh",null,"séi","hauh","beih","jong","yū","ging","geih","chèuhng","fuh","gahn",null,"jīk","fàahn","dai","gōng","síu","sāan","yāu","seuhng","dīk","gūng","guhng","mouh","deih","jūng",null,"daih","yih","sai","géi","sìh",null,"gaau","yáuh","yíh","joih","tā","dīk","mouh","seuhng","goi","gin","géi","nihm","ām",null,null,null,null,"nìhn",null,"gwān","sih","táan","dīng","wòhng","dai","joih","baak","dō","luhk","fàhn","mouh","seuhng","hīng","gin","daaih","dihn",null,"sahp","ńgh","sai","géi",null,"yùhn","yáuh","daaih","dihn","beih","chaak","chèuih",null,null,null,null,null,"nìhn","chùhng","gin","hauh","jūk","sing",null]},{"zh":"聖保祿宗徒於61年首次到羅馬，約於67年在羅馬巿郊的阿夸斯薩維亞斯被斬首殉道。","yale":["sing","bóu","luhk","jūng","tòuh","yū",null,null,"nìhn","sáu","chi","dou","lòh","máh",null,"yeuk","yū",null,null,"nìhn","joih","lòh","máh","fāt","gāau","dīk","a","kwā","sī","saat","wàih","a","sī","beih","jáam","sáu","sēun","douh",null]},{"zh":"最初保祿宗徒的遺體，被葬在奧斯蒂亞路附近的墓地。第二世紀已有教友在其墓上蓋建小龕。第四世紀時，君士坦丁皇帝在其墓上蓋建了一座大殿，約於324年11月8日祝聖。這大殿不幸於1823年焚毀，1840年重建後祝聖。","yale":["jeui","chō","bóu","luhk","jūng","tòuh","dīk","wàih","tái",null,"beih","jong","joih","ou","sī","dai","a","louh","fuh","gahn","dīk","mouh","deih",null,"daih","yih","sai","géi","yíh","yáuh","gaau","yáuh","joih","kèih","mouh","seuhng","goi","gin","síu","ām",null,"daih","sei","sai","géi","sìh",null,"gwān","sih","táan","dīng","wòhng","dai","joih","kèih","mouh","seuhng","goi","gin","líuh","yāt","joh","daaih","dihn",null,"yeuk","yū",null,null,null,"nìhn",null,null,"yuht",null,"yaht","jūk","sing",null,"jéh","daaih","dihn","bāt","hahng","yū",null,null,null,null,"nìhn","fàhn","wái",null,null,null,null,null,"nìhn","chùhng","gin","hauh","jūk","sing",null]},{"zh":"聖伯多祿、聖保祿是初期教會的兩大宗徒。聖伯多祿是宗徒之長，聖保祿是外邦人的導師。故此，這兩位大宗徒的聖殿奉獻日，為普世所紀念。","yale":["sing","baak","dō","luhk",null,"sing","bóu","luhk","sih","chō","kèih","gaau","wúi","dīk","léuhng","daaih","jūng","tòuh",null,"sing","baak","dō","luhk","sih","jūng","tòuh","jī","chèuhng",null,"sing","bóu","luhk","sih","ngoih","bōng","yàhn","dīk","douh","sī",null,"gu","chí",null,"jéh","léuhng","waih","daaih","jūng","tòuh","dīk","sing","dihn","fuhng","hin","yaht",null,"waih","póu","sai","só","géi","nihm",null]}],"proper":true,"en":{"source":"iBreviary","citation":null,"lines":["We have partaken of the gifts of this sacred mystery,","humbly imploring, O Lord,","that what your Son commanded us to do","in memory of him","may bring us growth in charity.","Through Christ our Lord."]},"la":{"source":"iBreviary","citation":null,"lines":["Súmpsimus, Dómine, sacri dona mystérii,","humíliter deprecántes,","ut, quæ in sui commemoratiónem","nos Fílius tuus fácere præcépit,","in nostræ profíciant caritátis augméntum.","Per Christum Dóminum nostrum"]}}]}